  InformationData[<|
   "ObjectType" -> "Symbol", "Usage" -> 
    "RegisterTensorData[target, moving] registers the moving tensor to the \
target tensor. After registration the tensor is reorinented apropriately. \n\
The inputs target and moving can be in the forms: tensor, {tensor, vox}, \
{tensor, mask} or {tensor, mask, vox}.\nRegisterTensorData[target, moving, \
tensor] registers the moving data to the target data and apllies the \
deformation to the tensor. \nThe inputs target and moving can be in the form: \
data, {data, vox}, {data, mask} or {data, mask, vox}.\nThe input tensor can \
be in the form: tensor or {tensor, vox}.\n\nonly \"rigid\", \"affine\" and \
\"bspline\" can be used as MetReg.", 
    "Documentation" -> <|
     "Local" -> "paclet:QMRITools/ref/RegisterTensorData"|>, "OwnValues" -> 
